### Methodology

This assessment uses the OpsMind Weighted Evaluation Algorithm v1, evaluating systems across four dimensions:

- **Hardware Compatibility (30%)**: CPU architecture, cores, memory capacity, disk space
- **Software Support (30%)**: OS version, kernel, package ecosystem, runtime compatibility
- **Configuration Complexity (20%)**: Services, dependencies, data volumes, network topology
- **Security Baseline (20%)**: Firewall status, SELinux, pending updates, open ports

